#: kiconedit.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "Novi &prozor"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"Novi prozor\n"
"\n"
"Otvora se novi prozor editora ikona."

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Nova\n"
"\n"
"Pravi se nova ikona, ili prema šablonu ili navođenjem veličine"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Otvori\n"
"\n"
"Otvara se postojeća ikona"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Snimi\n"
"\n"
"Snima se tekuća ikona"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"Štampaj\n"
"\n"
"Otvara se dijalog za štampu koji vam omogućava štampanje tekuće ikone."

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Izreži\n"
"\n"
"Ova opcija će izrezati (premjestiti u clipboard) trenutno izabrani dio "
"ikone.\n"
"\n"
"(Savjet: Možete napraviti i pravougaonu i kružnu selekciju)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Kopiraj\n"
"\n"
"Ova opcija kopira trenutno izabrani dio ikone.\n"
"\n"
"(Savjet: Možete napraviti i pravougaonu i kružnu selekciju)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"Umetni\n"
"\n"
"Sadržaj clipboarda će biti umetnut na trenutnu ikonu.\n"
"\n"
"Ako je sadržaj veći od ikone na kojoj radite, možete ga umetnuti u zaseban "
"prozor kao novu ikonu.\n"
"\n"
"(Savjet: Izaberite 'Umetni providne piksele' u dijalogu za podešavanje ako "
"želite da umetnite i one tačke koje su označene kao providni.)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "Umetni kao &novu ikonu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "P&romijeni veličinu..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"Promijeni veličinu\n"
"\n"
"Glatko se mijenja veličina ikone, trudeći se da sačuva njen sadržaj"

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "S&ive nijanse"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"Sive nijanse\n"
"\n"
"Boja tekuće ikone se pretvaraju u nijanse sive.\n"
"(Upozorenje: dobijeni rezultat će vjerovatno sadržavati boje koje se ne "
"nalaze u paleti ikone"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"Uvećaj\n"
"\n"
"Uvećava se za faktor jedan."

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"Umanji\n"
"\n"
"Umanjuje se za faktor jedan."

#: kiconedit.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr "&Uvećaj"

#: kiconedit.cpp:339
#, kde-format
msgid "100%"
msgstr "100%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid "200%"
msgstr "200%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid "500%"
msgstr "500%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:357
#, kde-format
msgid "1000%"
msgstr "1000%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:377
#, kde-format
msgid "Show &Grid"
msgstr "Prikaži &mrežu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:380
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide &Grid"
msgstr "Sakrij &mrežu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:381
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Show grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"Prikaži mrežu\n"
"\n"
"Ova opcija uklanja/prikazuje mrežu na kojoj crtate ikonu."

#: kiconedit.cpp:388
#, kde-format
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "Birač boja"

#: kiconedit.cpp:392
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Color Picker\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current draw color"
msgstr ""
"Birač boja\n"
"\n"
"Boja piksela na koji ste kliknuli će postati boja za crtanje"

#: kiconedit.cpp:397
#, kde-format
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "Slobodnom rukom"

#: kiconedit.cpp:401
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"Slobodnom rukom\n"
"\n"
"Crtanje nelinearnih linija"

#: kiconedit.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "Pravougaonik"

#: kiconedit.cpp:412
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Pravougaonik\n"
"\n"
"Crta se pravougaonik"

#: kiconedit.cpp:416
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Rectangle"
msgstr "Popunjeni pravougaonik"

#: kiconedit.cpp:420
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Popunjeni pravougaonik\n"
"\n"
"Crta se popunjeni pravougaonik"

#: kiconedit.cpp:424
#, kde-format
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "Krug"

#: kiconedit.cpp:428
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"Krug\n"
"\n"
"Crta se krug"

#: kiconedit.cpp:432
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Circle"
msgstr "Popunjeni krug"

#: kiconedit.cpp:436
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"Popunjeni krug\n"
"\n"
"Crta se popunjeni krug"

#: kiconedit.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "Elipsa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:444
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Elipsa\n"
"\n"
"Crta se elipsa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:448
#, kde-format
msgid "Filled Ellipse"
msgstr "Popunjena elipsa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:452
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Popunjena elipsa\n"
"\n"
"Crta se popunjena elipsa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:456
#, kde-format
msgid "Spray"
msgstr "Sprej"

#: kiconedit.cpp:460
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"Sprej\n"
"\n"
"Crtaju se raštrkani pikseli u trenutnoj boji"

#: kiconedit.cpp:465
#, kde-format
msgid "Flood Fill"
msgstr "Popunjavanje"

#: kiconedit.cpp:469
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"Popunjavanje\n"
"\n"
"Pikseli iste boje koji se dodiruju biće prebojeni tekućom bojom"

#: kiconedit.cpp:474
#, kde-format
msgid "Line"
msgstr "Linija"

#: kiconedit.cpp:478
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontally or at 45 deg. angles"
msgstr ""
"Linija\n"
"\n"
"Crta se prava linija uspravno, vodoravno ili pod uglom od 45 stepeni"

#: kiconedit.cpp:483
#, kde-format
msgid "Eraser (Transparent)"
msgstr "Brisač (za providnost)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:487
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparency with a different tool, first click on "
"\"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"Briši\n"
"\n"
"Brišu se pikseli tako da postaju providni\n"
"\n"
"(Savjet: Ako želite da crtate providne piksele nekim drugim alatom, najprije "
"kliknite na \"Briši\", a zatim na alat koji želite da korisitite)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:494
#, kde-format
msgid "Rectangular Selection"
msgstr "Pravougaoni izbor"

#: kiconedit.cpp:498
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a rectangular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Izaberi\n"
"\n"
"Izabire se pravougaona sekcija ikone upotrebom miša."

#: kiconedit.cpp:503
#, kde-format
msgid "Circular Selection"
msgstr "Kružni izbor"

#: kiconedit.cpp:507
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a circular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Izaberi\n"
"\n"
"Izabire se kružna sekcija ikone upotrebom miša."

#: kiconedit.cpp:535
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information on the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Application messages\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors"
msgstr ""
"Statusna traka\n"
"\n"
"Statusna traka daje informacije o statusu ikone na kojoj radite. Opisna "
"polja su:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Poruke programa\n"
"\t- Položaj kursora\n"
"\t- Veličina\n"
"\t- Faktor uvećanja\n"
"\t- Broj boja"

